Package: AchillesNext
Type: Package
Title: Development Tracer for OMOP Characterization Results
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Alex", "Chen", email = "alex@omophub.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Precomputes exact population demographics and observation baselines
    from PostgreSQL OMOP sources into a restricted typed aggregate store. Includes
    a separate bounded synthetic measurement tracer, versioned bundles, approved
    publication tools and a reusable React view. Provides an experimental core
    batch planner, transaction-private staging and conservative recomputation.
    Complete multi-domain generation, general input reuse and production-scale
    qualification are not yet implemented.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: DatabaseConnector (>= 6.3.2), digest, jsonlite, rJava, httpuv (>= 1.6.0)
SystemRequirements: Java (>= 8), PostgreSQL JDBC driver
URL: https://github.com/alex-omophub/achilles-next
BugReports: https://github.com/alex-omophub/achilles-next/issues
